{"study_accession":"PRJNA1344838","secondary_study_accession":"SRP632981","title":"Single-cell transcriptomic profiling of peripheral B cells from preclinical and clinical rheumatoid arthritis patients and healthy comparators","description":"This project aims to dissect immune cell heterogeneity and activation states in preclinical and clinical rheumatoid arthritis by integrating single-cell transcriptomic (scRNA-seq), B/T cell receptor repertoire (VDJ-seq), and surface protein (CITE-seq) profiling. Peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) were isolated from individuals at various stages of RA progression as well as healthy controls. Using 10x Genomics Chromium technology and Illumina sequencing, we generated matched gene expression, immune repertoire, and antibody-tagged surface protein libraries for each sample. These datasets will enable comprehensive analysis of immune cell subsets, BCR/TCR clonotypes, and protein-level phenotypes to identify early disease-associated signatures and regulatory mechanisms underlying autoimmune progression.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":26,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN52655318","study_accession":"PRJNA1344838","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"NN1A","description":"NN1A","sex":"female","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":2,"first_public":"2026-07-02","attributes":[["isolate","NN1A"],["age","69"],["biomaterial_provider","Kevin D. Deane"],["collection_date","2023-11-21"],["geo_loc_name","USA"],["sex","female"],["tissue","PBMCs"],["cell_subtype","B cells"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR35801767","experiment_accession":"SRX30850982","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq X Plus","read_count":75913870,"base_count":22774161000,"first_public":"2026-07-02","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq X Plus sequencing: CITE-seq of NN1A sample"},{"run_accession":"SRR35801768","experiment_accession":"SRX30850981","library_layout":"PAIRED","library